WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.940
Respiration is how living things get energy from food.

00:03.940 --> 00:08.310
It happens inside every cell, mainly in mitochondria.

00:08.310 --> 00:12.460
Glucose (from food) and oxygen combine.

00:12.460 --> 00:17.088
A chemical reaction breaks down glucose in the presence of oxygen.

00:17.089 --> 00:22.539
This releases ATP energy, water, and carbon dioxide waste.
